The TFR applies to all aircraft operations, including unmanned aircraft systems, unless the aircraft operator meets at least one of the following requirements:

A) The aircraft operation has been authorized by Air Traffic Control (ATC) for operational or safety purposes;

B) The aircraft operation is being conducted for operational, safety, or security purposes supporting the qualifying event, and is authorized by an airspace security waiver approved by the FAA;

C) The aircraft operation is enabling broadcast coverage for the broadcast rights holder for the qualifying event and is authorized by an airspace security waiver approved by the FAA;

D) The aircraft operation has been authorized by ATC for national security, homeland security, law enforcement, or air ambulance purposes. available.

